    "data": {
      "id": 1774,
      "hub_id": 2411,
      "guid": "com.rcta.callisto",
      "name": "RCTA - Callisto Standard, Deluge [CODMW3]",
      "slug": "rcta-callisto-standard-deluge-codmw3",
      "teaser": "Callisto Standard and Deluge Operator Outfits from Call of Duty : Modern Warfare 3 (2023)",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2411.png",
      "downloads": 3821,
      "favourites_count": 3,
      "description": "<h3>**RCTA - Callisto Standard, Deluge [CODMW3]</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/U2ONOpy.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U2ONOpy.gif\" alt=\"U2ONOpy.gif\" /></a>**</p>\n<p><strong>Mod Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>I was considering porting ALL operator skins for Callisto but most have too much gear on, maybe at a later date I’ll look into it. Hope you enjoy! Sorry about the darker textures on some materials, it’s a cod thing. The “empty” head by the way is for wearing any head-gear to prevent clipping!</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mod Includes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Standard [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Standard [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Deluge [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Deluge [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Standard [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Snake Standard Empty [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Support</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out my other work on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY</a></li>\n<li>Donate or maybe look into commissions on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/trappucci\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/trappucci</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Credits</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Infinity Ward, Sledgehammer Games</li>\n<li>GrooveypenguinX for framework</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Media</strong></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1774/rcta-callisto-standard-deluge-codmw3",
